th written responses, keeping students engaged and verifying completion.

- The platform also offers resources on social and emotional learning, fitn=
ess concepts, and mindfulness.

The company closed a $1.3m (https://techcrunch.com/2025/02/07/hiveclass-a-p=
latform-for-virtual-pe-classes-for-kids-raises-1-5m/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--MjaF=
Hbgn7Qm2cppNPdE4JAWNgXDK6gB1HFeP8pmchLN_M7ZEmPnoUonCudNDOSuIEzeMZPvGGSAYKQr=
K_5rlJTcaZeA&_hsmi=3D397235830 ) seed round in 2025, has generated $2m+ in =
revenue, and serves 13k+ teachers and students through 80+ educational inst=
itutions.

The pandemic is over =E2=80=94 why=E2=80=99s it still growing?

Because children are like Jack Russell Terriers.

Without exercise, they can have behavioral issues, develop long-term health=
 complications, and rip your house to shreds while you're in the shower.

However, traditional avenues for keeping kids active can be problematic.

- Overcompetitiveness and bullying can lead to disengagement from PE =E2=80=
=94 a major problem in school districts (https://www.inc.com/jennifer-conra=
d/how-this-small-business-hit-1-million-in-revenue-with-a-simple-service-ki=
ds-gym-class.html?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--MjaFHbgn7Qm2cppNPdE4JAWNgXDK6gB1HFeP8pm=
chLN_M7ZEmPnoUonCudNDOSuIEzeMZPvGGSAYKQrK_5rlJTcaZeA&_hsmi=3D397235830 ) wh=
ere it's required for graduation.

- The rising costs of organized sports can be prohibitively expensive for m=
any families.

Hiveclass aims to cover those bases by offering a discreet, cost-effective,=
 non-judgmental alternative to conventional physical education.

And while other remote training resources =E2=80=94 Peloton (https://www.on=
epeloton.com/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--MjaFHbgn7Qm2cppNPdE4JAWNgXDK6gB1HFeP8pmchLN=
_M7ZEmPnoUonCudNDOSuIEzeMZPvGGSAYKQrK_5rlJTcaZeA&_hsmi=3D397235830 ) , Trai=
ningPeaks (https://www.trainingpeaks.com/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--MjaFHbgn7Qm2cpp=
NPdE4JAWNgXDK6gB1HFeP8pmchLN_M7ZEmPnoUonCudNDOSuIEzeMZPvGGSAYKQrK_5rlJTcaZe=
A&_hsmi=3D397235830 ) =E2=80=94 exist, Hiveclass differentiates itself with=
 its business model.

It prioritizes kids and targets schools instead of consumers =E2=80=94 maki=
ng it a compelling case study in identifying an underserved market with a d=
ated process in need of a modern approach.

=F0=9F=94=97 (https://thehustle.co/news/duck-this-company-brings-dodgeball-=
digital?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--MjaFHbgn7Qm2cppNPdE4JAWNgXDK6gB1HFeP8pmchLN_M7ZEm=
PnoUonCudNDOSuIEzeMZPvGGSAYKQrK_5rlJTcaZeA&_hsmi=3D397235830 )

