>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Hardly any of us have fond memories of PE. Ju=
st rope-climbing burns and bruised egos.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Physical education is a stressful, necessary =
staple of American public schools =E2=80=94 but replicating it proved trick=
y when the pandemic shifted education online.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That's where <a  href=3D"https://media.hubspo=
t.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW0Tnj2FKgj2W6H7PQ98TXyJMV1-ywc5H_-0XN8GDX5n2=
-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3mtW7PZZbw2fjycHW200-PQ7wZZNdW7MBHgT4n0ynCW2TW0WF3t-6n3W8fRtM=
