 $2m+ in revenue, and serves 13k+ teachers and students through 80+ educati=
onal institutions.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">The pandemi=
c is over =E2=80=94 why=E2=80=99s it still growing?&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Because children are like Jack Russell Terrie=
rs.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Without exercise, they can have behavioral is=
sues, develop long-term health complications, and rip your house to shreds =
while you're in the shower.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">However, traditional avenues for keeping kids=
 active can be problematic.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Overcompetitiveness and bullying can&nbsp;lead to dise=
ngagement from PE =E2=80=94 a major problem in <a href=3D"https://media.hub=
spot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW0Tnj2FKgj2W6H7PQ98TXyJMV1-ywc5H_-0XN8GDX=
