<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">The el=
evator pitch:</span> =E2=80=9CBrief is calm, honest software for messy docu=
ment realities, designed to reduce cognitive load, not add to it. We're the=
 GitHub of documents. Documents are chaotic. Brief makes them behave.=E2=80=
=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">The pr=
oblem they=E2=80=99re solving: </span>=E2=80=9DToday, everyone treats their=
 document folder like a trashcan and then adds appendages like approvals an=
d signatures. We're a self-organizing platform for all your messy documents=
.=E2=80=9D<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Origin sto=
ry: </span>=E2=80=9CWe're neurodivergent founders with ADHD and all of our =
documents sit in an internet trashcan of Google Drive. My co-founder and I =
have been friends for over 20 years, starting our first company when we wer=
e 19."<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">One truly =
innovative thing they=E2=80=99re doing: </span>=E2=80=9CWe're treating docu=
ments like a library of you. We index documents like the Dewey Decimal Syst=
em, where every document is auto-tagged to be easily found.=E2=80=9D<br><br=
></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Biggest wi=
n of the last year: </span>=E2=80=9CWe were selected out of thousands to sp=
end the week at Seth Godin's studio and get his advice on startups and mark=
eting.=E2=80=9D<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-style: italic;">What are =
